## Layer Rules

| Layer | Package | Rule |
|-------|---------|------|
| Handler | `internal/api/handler/` | HTTP ONLY. Parse request → call orchestrator → return response. No business logic. |
| Orchestration | `internal/api/orchestration/` | Coordinates services. No direct DB access. No HTTP imports. |
| Service | `internal/service/` | Business logic. Single responsibility. No `net/http`. |
| Repository | `internal/repository/` | Database ONLY (Bun ORM). No business logic. No service calls. |
| Domain | `internal/domain/` | Interfaces + entity structs. No implementation. |

---

## Naming Conventions

| Type | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Interface | `I{Entity}Service`, `I{Entity}Repository` | `I{{ index .Entities 0 }}Service` |
| Struct | `{Entity}Service`, `{Entity}Repository` | `{{ index .Entities 0 }}Service` |
| Constructor | `New{Type}` | `New{{ index .Entities 0 }}Service(...)` |
| Handler method | `Create{Entity}`, `Get{Entity}`, `List{Entity}s` | `Create{{ index .Entities 0 }}` |
| File | `{entity}_{layer}.go` | `{{ lower (index .Entities 0) }}_service.go` |
| Test file | `{entity}_{layer}_test.go` | `{{ lower (index .Entities 0) }}_service_test.go` |
| Migration | `NNN_create_{entity}s.sql` | `001_create_{{ lower (index .Entities 0) }}s.sql` |

