## Entity Design Pattern

Using `{{ index .Entities 0 }}` as example (all entities follow this pattern):

```go
// internal/domain/entities.go
type {{ index .Entities 0 }} struct {
    bun.BaseModel `bun:"table:{{ lower (index .Entities 0) }}s,alias:{{ abbreviate (index .Entities 0) }}"`

    ID        uuid.UUID  `bun:"id,pk,type:uuid,default:gen_random_uuid()" json:"id"`
    // ... domain fields
    Version   int        `bun:"version"                                    json:"version"`
    CreatedAt time.Time  `bun:"created_at,nullzero,notnull,default:now()"  json:"createdAt"`
    UpdatedAt time.Time  `bun:"updated_at,nullzero,notnull,default:now()"  json:"updatedAt"`
    DeletedAt *time.Time `bun:"deleted_at,soft_delete,nullzero"             json:"deletedAt,omitempty"`
}
```

